      "source": [
        "## 3. Modelo de referencia y clasificación\n",
        "\n",
        "Las variables numéricas se imputan y escalan; las categóricas se transforman con *One-Hot Encoding*. Estas transformaciones se ajustan únicamente con los datos de entrenamiento, dentro del `Pipeline`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 9,
      "id": "1a483483",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "1a483483",
        "outputId": "2bc03a81-5d4f-44b3-8774-9c82bc62e12f"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Accuracy referencia: 0.932\n",
            "F1 referencia: 0.0\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "preprocesamiento = ColumnTransformer([\n",
        "    ('numericas', make_pipeline(SimpleImputer(strategy='median'),\n",
        "                               StandardScaler()), columnas_numericas),\n",
        "    ('categoricas', make_pipeline(SimpleImputer(strategy='most_frequent'),\n",
        "                                 OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown='ignore')),\n",
        "     columnas_categoricas)\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "referencia = DummyClassifier(strategy='most_frequent')\n",
        "referencia.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
        "pred_ref = referencia.predict(X_valid)\n",
        "\n",
        "print('Accuracy referencia:', round(accuracy_score(y_valid, pred_ref), 3))\n",
        "print('F1 referencia:', round(f1_score(y_valid, pred_ref, zero_division=0), 3))"
      ]
    },
